# Convex
.convex/
# NOTE: convex/_generated is intentionally TRACKED (not ignored). This repo's CI
# has no live Convex deployment to run `convex codegen`, so the generated files are
# hand-authored to mirror codegen output and committed so `pnpm typecheck` covers
# the backend on a fresh checkout. A local `convex dev` will regenerate them.

